' Agentic Enterprise vs Autonomous Enterprise visualization
'
' Per CR-ES-010 §20 + ADR-ES-010 §11 + ADR-ES-011 §11 + §13.
' Illustrates the orthogonality between Agentic Enterprise and
' Autonomous Enterprise as parallel Enterprise specialisations.
'
' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-24)

@startuml agentic-vs-autonomous-enterprise

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
    FontColor #000000
}

skinparam arrow {
    Color #2F4F4F
    FontColor #2F4F4F
}

title Agentic Enterprise vs Autonomous Enterprise ,  Orthogonality

rectangle "Enterprise" as enterprise #E0E8F0

rectangle "Agentic Enterprise" as ae #FFE4B5
rectangle "Autonomous Enterprise" as autonomous #FFE4E1

enterprise --> ae : specialises
enterprise --> autonomous : specialises

rectangle "Agentic + Autonomous Enterprise" as both #E6E6FA

ae --> both : orthogonal-mode
autonomous --> both : orthogonal-mode

note bottom of both
  Per ADR-ES-010 §13 + ADR-ES-011 §11:
  The two concepts are orthogonal semantic
  dimensions. An enterprise may satisfy
  neither, either, or both classifications.
  The fourth state is a valid combination
  of semantic characteristics but does NOT
  result in creation of a new canonical concept.
end note

@enduml
